WEBVTT

00:00:01.898 --> 00:00:07.380
Real voices. Real survival. Real protection.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.040
So, the fire in our home occurred

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.579
on the 26th of January of this year.

00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:15.980
Basically, it was just

00:00:15.991 --> 00:00:18.240
another normal day where myself

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.850
like obviously along with my

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.860
my husband like other

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.080
couples taking care of our

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.660
home and the daily affairs.

00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:26.100
Um, before going to bed

00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:27.370
we placed our laundry in

00:00:27.376 --> 00:00:30.921
the tumble dryer, and went to bed as

00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:32.851
usual. Suddenly,

00:00:32.852 --> 00:00:35.461
something just woke me up.

00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:38.671
I honestly did not smell

00:00:38.657 --> 00:00:40.461
any smoke or any

00:00:40.472 --> 00:00:42.622
sounds. I just suddenly woke up

00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:44.062
and I saw the smoke

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.052
and immediately became aware

00:00:45.071 --> 00:00:47.112
that this was a case involving fire.

00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:49.792
Obviously, I immediately woke up

00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:54.252
my husband and the children.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:56.763
We saw the fire coming out

00:00:56.768 --> 00:00:59.081
out from the kitchen area

00:00:59.099 --> 00:01:01.881
where there is the tumble dryer.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:04.176
The tumble dryer was on fire obviously.

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:06.246
The fault was from the tumble dryer,

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.236
it turned on fire because there

00:01:08.219 --> 00:01:10.006
is a part within that was not

00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:12.706
functioning well,

00:01:12.717 --> 00:01:15.779
and this part obviously failed

00:01:15.778 --> 00:01:17.489
to cutoff during heat

00:01:17.484 --> 00:01:19.489
and caused the fire.

00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:21.359
I would like to add that

00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:22.816
the tumble dryer wasn't our

00:01:22.806 --> 00:01:24.196
fault or negligence from

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.476
our end.

00:01:25.508 --> 00:01:26.846
We obviously took care

00:01:26.851 --> 00:01:28.296
and repaired the tumble dryer

00:01:28.308 --> 00:01:30.566
a few days before,

00:01:30.579 --> 00:01:32.762
not even a month prior.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.592
It was an appliance which

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:38.515
we haven't bought years ago,

00:01:38.518 --> 00:01:41.065
but an appliance bought

00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:43.660
much less than two years.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.940
Obviously the first thing one

00:01:45.963 --> 00:01:47.940
does is to fix the matter,

00:01:47.948 --> 00:01:50.180
right, and you take

00:01:50.189 --> 00:01:52.080
from the technician.

00:01:52.081 --> 00:01:54.040
We are not knowledgeable

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:55.280
in such areas,

00:01:55.273 --> 00:01:56.496
therefore you obviously

00:01:56.493 --> 00:01:58.555
turn to those who have a better understanding.

00:01:58.557 --> 00:02:00.795
Following that, the tumble dryer

00:02:00.798 --> 00:02:02.485
was working as normal,

00:02:02.481 --> 00:02:04.545
but then, the problem occurred

00:02:04.545 --> 00:02:07.314
concerning the part which we had fixed.

00:02:07.312 --> 00:02:12.364
A major part of our home that

00:02:12.357 --> 00:02:14.857
endured damage is the kitchen area,

00:02:14.866 --> 00:02:18.688
but obviously, the damage affected

00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:21.189
the entire home.

00:02:21.206 --> 00:02:23.453
From the kitchen, the fire was spreading

00:02:23.439 --> 00:02:25.513
into the living room.

00:02:25.513 --> 00:02:32.013
The air-condition and other equipment

00:02:32.003 --> 00:02:33.801
were damaged

00:02:33.821 --> 00:02:35.271
In reality, the only thing which we managed

00:02:35.292 --> 00:02:36.371
to save from the entire home

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:38.011
are this sofa that we are sitting on

00:02:38.014 --> 00:02:40.131
and the television.

00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:46.097
Obviously, since we called

00:02:46.097 --> 00:02:47.727
the first responders

00:02:47.727 --> 00:02:49.587
and the fire engines arrived,

00:02:49.607 --> 00:02:51.287
and these sorts of things,

00:02:51.299 --> 00:02:52.957
and they need to extinguish the fire.

00:02:52.969 --> 00:02:55.477
Obviously, things got damaged,

00:03:02.216 --> 00:03:04.716
but we were not injured thanks God,

00:03:08.993 --> 00:03:11.506
especially since we received

00:03:11.512 --> 00:03:13.776
immediate assistance

00:03:13.776 --> 00:03:16.276
thanks to the fire brigade

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:19.870
Who in a very short period

00:03:19.872 --> 00:03:21.320
they arrived at our door step,

00:03:21.313 --> 00:03:23.462
in less than 7 minutes.

00:03:23.989 --> 00:03:25.402
But obviously,

00:03:25.385 --> 00:03:27.722
you are affected from an emotionally.

00:03:27.734 --> 00:03:32.469
The fact that my first instinct, 

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.749
I couldn't find my daughter,

00:03:34.761 --> 00:03:37.017
feel the matter as taking a lot of time.

00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:42.567
Our daughter is 5 years old,

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.647
and so the risk of being entrapped 

00:03:44.667 --> 00:03:46.547
in the smoke or fire is higher,

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:48.937
and breathing would become even

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:50.831
more difficult leading to a moment

00:03:50.831 --> 00:03:52.181
of panic.

00:03:52.181 --> 00:03:53.091
We received care concerning

00:03:53.091 --> 00:03:54.201
emotional damage,

00:03:54.201 --> 00:03:55.831
we went for therapy and received

00:03:55.827 --> 00:03:58.131
psychological care as we have

00:03:58.125 --> 00:04:00.551
been guided.  

00:04:00.556 --> 00:04:03.896
So, thanks God, 

00:04:03.896 --> 00:04:05.976
we received the aftercare

00:04:05.986 --> 00:04:08.586
which helped us to move forward.

00:04:08.584 --> 00:04:11.416
Obviously, there would still be

00:04:11.412 --> 00:04:14.912
the effects of what occurred, 

00:04:14.909 --> 00:04:18.032
which involves nightmares and wake

00:04:18.029 --> 00:04:22.806
up in shock and memories of what

00:04:22.798 --> 00:04:26.286
took place. But obviously, live goes on.

00:04:26.284 --> 00:04:28.254
Financially this was certainly a hit,

00:04:28.254 --> 00:04:31.424
we have been here only for 6 months

00:04:31.427 --> 00:04:33.924
and everything was still new.

00:04:33.927 --> 00:04:38.177
So, we were already within a financial

00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:40.877
expense involving the moving process.

00:04:40.869 --> 00:04:43.647
Obviously, the incident occurred,

00:04:43.643 --> 00:04:45.150
and the matter became even bigger.

00:04:45.149 --> 00:04:46.440
When we moved in,

00:04:46.445 --> 00:04:48.303
there wasn't much work which

00:04:48.313 --> 00:04:50.720
we required to do, but,

00:04:50.717 --> 00:04:54.270
due to the fire, our expenses got bigger,

00:04:54.272 --> 00:04:57.694
almost tripled.

00:04:57.692 --> 00:05:00.104
Something which I highly

00:05:00.105 --> 00:05:03.114
recommend is to take all the necessary precautions,

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:08.715
and to have the required emergency

00:05:08.713 --> 00:05:10.865
equipment such as fire extinguishers,

00:05:10.855 --> 00:05:13.434
fire blankets, fire alarms.

00:05:13.433 --> 00:05:16.462
These are things that if myself

00:05:16.464 --> 00:05:19.602
and my family already had in place,

00:05:19.602 --> 00:05:22.192
we would have avoided some

00:05:22.203 --> 00:05:24.613
of the problems that occurred.

00:05:24.612 --> 00:05:26.323
For example, if there would be

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.750
smoke, and the fire alarm would go off,

00:05:28.764 --> 00:05:30.410
obviously we would have

00:05:30.417 --> 00:05:32.500
called for help earlier. 

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.170
These are things that I

00:05:35.171 --> 00:05:36.680
believe are necessary 

00:05:36.682 --> 00:05:38.882
as other necessary things

00:05:38.872 --> 00:05:40.352
that one has in the kitchen

00:05:40.351 --> 00:05:42.073
and their daily lives.

00:05:42.073 --> 00:05:44.443
Nowadays, if you had to come

00:05:44.442 --> 00:05:45.573
over to our home,

00:05:45.572 --> 00:05:46.393
you will find these

00:05:46.393 --> 00:05:47.763
in all the rooms,

00:05:47.765 --> 00:05:49.123
including fire extinguishers and fire blanket.

00:05:49.127 --> 00:05:52.933
This experience helped

00:05:52.945 --> 00:05:55.842
us to learn.

00:05:55.843 --> 00:05:58.242
Those who are watching this interview,

00:05:58.243 --> 00:06:00.843
my advice is to never wait

00:06:00.849 --> 00:06:02.868
for an accident to occur

00:06:02.858 --> 00:06:05.113
God forbid before acting.

00:06:05.128 --> 00:06:07.340
Following this interview, 

00:06:07.363 --> 00:06:09.150
these should be part of your plan.

00:06:09.157 --> 00:06:13.810
Nowadays, thanks God,

00:06:13.816 --> 00:06:15.776
our position is much better.

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:17.706
We came back to our home after 4

00:06:17.718 --> 00:06:20.536
months and obviously these

00:06:20.537 --> 00:06:23.446
were 4 months of hard times.

00:06:23.454 --> 00:06:27.336
My husband also had to take 

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.030
some time off from his work

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.540
in order to accelerate the process

00:06:31.546 --> 00:06:34.626
to move in as soon as possible. 

00:06:36.827 --> 00:06:41.723
We turned this place in shell form,

00:06:41.727 --> 00:06:48.055
including the bathrooms.

00:06:48.057 --> 00:06:51.925
Obviously you then need to start again

00:06:51.925 --> 00:06:54.665
from the beginning which 

00:06:54.663 --> 00:06:56.775
takes some time.

00:06:56.772 --> 00:06:58.725
Emotionally speaking, 

00:06:58.728 --> 00:07:01.120
I myself am in a much better state.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.230
As I told you earlier, we

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.200
received the necessary care,

00:07:05.201 --> 00:07:06.630
psychological help and

00:07:06.628 --> 00:07:08.850
therapy that we needed.

00:07:08.851 --> 00:07:10.180
Our children, thanks God,

00:07:10.194 --> 00:07:13.842
we tried to present the matter

00:07:13.863 --> 00:07:16.022
from a positive side.

00:07:19.022 --> 00:07:21.802
For them the fire brigade and police

00:07:21.802 --> 00:07:24.822
are their heroes,

00:07:24.817 --> 00:07:28.172
particularly since they treated them so well

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.680
on the day, that for them

00:07:30.674 --> 00:07:35.494
we were special since we encountered these heroes.

00:07:35.489 --> 00:07:39.589
The fire man gathered some items 

00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:41.559
and managed to save some items

00:07:41.563 --> 00:07:44.063
which my kids remember 

00:07:44.072 --> 00:07:46.572
more than the fire itself.

00:07:46.573 --> 00:07:49.936
 My daughter remembers the police 

00:07:49.936 --> 00:07:51.926
in particular who wrapped here

00:07:51.927 --> 00:07:53.856
in a scarf because we took

00:07:53.868 --> 00:07:56.126
her out in her underwear.

00:07:56.125 --> 00:07:57.765
From this negative experience,

00:07:57.769 --> 00:07:59.235
there is still something positive 

00:07:59.231 --> 00:08:03.445
which our children took.

00:08:05.336 --> 00:08:09.261
Financially, obviously we need to recover

00:08:09.257 --> 00:08:11.151
from the hit that we faced.

00:08:11.151 --> 00:08:15.961
We both continued with our routines now,

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.465
and when you are careful

00:08:18.468 --> 00:08:19.405
with your expenses,

00:08:19.403 --> 00:08:23.367
obviously you start rebuilding your life.